<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<h1>Programs offered by GB College Ramgarh</h1>
<div class="program-container">
  <div class="specific-program">
    <h2>Bachelor of Arts (B.A.)</h2>
    <div class="program-specific-subjects">
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>History</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/History.jpg" alt="Sphinx image" />
        <p>
          Ever wondered how past events shaped the world we live in today?
          History takes you on a journey through people, civilizations, and
          events that changed society.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Political Science</h2>
        <img
          class="desc-img"
          src="/images/PoliticalScience.jpg"
          alt="politics image"
        />
        <p>
          Who makes the decisions that shape a country and its society?
          Political Science explores governments, political systems, power, and
          public policies.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Economics</h2>
        <img
          class="desc-img"
          src="/images/Economics.jpg"
          alt="Economics image"
        />
        <p>
          Why do prices change, businesses grow, and economies rise or fall?
          Economics helps you understand how people, markets, and resources
          shape the world.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Geography</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/Geography.jpg" alt="globe image" />
        <p>
          What connects people, places, environments, and the changing world
          around us? Geography helps you understand how our planet and human
          societies interact.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Sociology</h2>
        <img
          class="desc-img"
          src="/images/Sociology.jpg"
          alt="Sociology image"
        />
        <p>
          Why do people behave differently in groups and societies? Sociology
          helps you explore social relationships, communities, cultures, and the
          forces that shape human life.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Psychology</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/Psychology.jpg" alt="brain image" />
        <p>
          What influences the way people think, feel, and behave? Psychology
          explores the human mind and helps us understand behaviour and
          emotions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Philosophy</h2>
        <img
          class="desc-img"
          src="/images/Philosophy.jpg"
          alt="Philosophy image"
        />
        <p>
          Have you ever questioned what knowledge, truth, or the purpose of life
          really means? Philosophy encourages you to explore life's biggest
          questions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Language</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/English.jpg" alt="language image" />
        <p>
          How do words, stories, and languages shape the way we communicate and
          understand the world? Studying languages helps you explore
          communication, literature, culture, and human expression.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="specific-program">
    <h2>Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.)</h2>
    <div class="program-specific-subjects">
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Botany</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/Botany.jpg" alt="plant image" />
        <p>
          Ever wondered how plants grow, survive, and shape life on Earth?
          Studying Botany lets you explore the fascinating world of plants and
          their importance to our environment.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Zoology</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/Zoology.jpg" alt="zebras image" />
        <p>
          Fascinated by animals and curious about how they live, evolve, and
          interact with their environment? Zoology opens the door to exploring
          the science of animal life.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Physics</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/Physics.jpg" alt="Physics image" />
        <p>
          Ever wondered how the universe works, from the smallest particles to
          the movement of planets? Physics helps you explore the laws behind the
          world around us.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Chemistry</h2>
        <img
          class="desc-img"
          src="/images/Chemistry.jpg"
          alt="chemicals image"
        />
        <p>
          Curious about what everything around you is made of and how substances
          transform? Chemistry helps you explore this.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-card">
        <h2>Maths</h2>
        <img class="desc-img" src="/images/Maths.jpg" alt="expression image" />
        <p>
          Do patterns, numbers, and problem-solving spark your curiosity?
          Mathematics helps you explore the logic and ideas behind the world
          around us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="specific-program">
    <h2>Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com.)</h2>
    <div class="program-card">
      <h2>BCom</h2>
      <img class="desc-img" src="/images/BBA.jpg" alt="computer image" />
      <p>
        Ever wondered how businesses manage money, track profits, and make
        financial decisions? Commerce helps you explore accounting, finance,
        business, and the world of trade.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="specific-program">
    <h2>Bachelor of Computer Application</h2>
    <div class="program-card">
      <h2>BCA</h2>
      <img class="desc-img" src="/images/BCA.jpg" alt="computer image" />
      <p>
        Students interested in computers, programming, software, technology, and
        problem-solving should choose BCA to build careers in the growing IT
        industry.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="specific-program">
    <h2>Bachelor of Business Administration</h2>
    <div class="program-card">
      <h2>BBA</h2>
      <img class="desc-img" src="/images/BBA.jpg" alt="calulation image" />
      <p>
        Are you interested in business, management, entrepreneurship, or
        leadership? Then BBA might be the right programme for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
